              "type": "string",
              "value": "Return exactly one messageListWidget JSON object with this content: patternId messageListWidget; description Supplier lifecycle workspace; properties.items contains exactly two neutral items. Item 1 title Query suppliers, summary Ask Oracle to find an existing supplier before any create. Item 2 title Create with confirmation, summary Provide only required fields, review the exact draft, then explicitly confirm before a write. Do not add actions, fields, markdown, or explanation."
            },
            {
              "id": "700_systemPrompt",
